,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo normalize the vector $v$, we divide $v$ by its norm $‖v‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =\\frac{v}{‖v‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334601 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334602 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334603 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334604 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186334605 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1041 "selection" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1104 #edb/ref 17592186334605 13194139535161 true] [17592186334600 1110 #uuid "7f05ae56-af1f-5e7f-bdaa-ec32824f1103" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334601 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334601 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535161 true] [17592186334601 1111 #uuid "eacab1e4-8780-58a1-bee7-2ccbc24c1be0" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334602 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535161 true] [17592186334602 1111 #uuid "ba99b293-2d2e-5988-9135-d30a447404a3" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334603 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535161 true] [17592186334603 1111 #uuid "70363edc-5c98-5acd-9e0e-020072de6b0b" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334604 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535161 true] [17592186334604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535161 true] [17592186334604 1111 #uuid "25a72321-510d-5011-bdad